  "CLAUDE.md": {
    "scope": "markdown",
    "prefix": "claude::claude.md",
    "isFileTemplate": true,
    "include": "CLAUDE.md",
    "description": "CLAUDE.md: tech stack and project conventions for Claude Code",
    "body": [
      "# Project Configuration",
      "",
      "## Tech Stack",
      "",
      "- **Framework**: SvelteKit 2 + Svelte 5 (runes — no legacy stores API)",
      "- **Language**: TypeScript (Node >=22.16)",
      "- **Build**: Vite 8",
      "- **Package Manager**: pnpm (>=10)",
      "- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4",
      "- **Validation**: Zod 4",
      "- **Deploy**: adapter-auto → Cloudflare (Docker available)",
      "- **Tooling**: Prettier, ESLint, Husky + lint-staged",
      "",
      "## Commands",
      "",
      "| Command                          | What it does                         |",
      "| -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |",
      "| `pnpm dev`                       | Dev server (--open)                  |",
      "| `pnpm build`                     | Production build (vite)              |",
      "| `pnpm preview`                   | Preview prod build                   |",
      "| `pnpm check`                     | svelte-check (types)                 |",
      "| `pnpm lint`                      | prettier --check + eslint            |",
      "| `pnpm format`                    | prettier --write                     |",
      "| `pnpm design:lint`               | Validate .claude/DESIGN.md vs spec   |",
      "| `pnpm docker:up` / `docker:down` | Docker compose                       |",
      "",
      "## Production Directory Structure",
      "",
      "```text",
      "src/lib/",
      "├── components/ui/        # Buttons, inputs, cards",
      "├── components/layout/    # Header, Footer, Sidebar",
      "├── server/db/            # Database (Drizzle / Prisma)",
      "├── server/auth/          # Auth logic (Lucia etc.)",
      "├── stores/               # Svelte stores / runes",
      "├── utils/                # Helper functions",
      "├── schemas/              # Zod schemas (validation) — type via z.infer",
      "└── types/                # Pure TS types (no runtime, no validation)",
      "src/routes/",
      "├── (landing)/            # Public marketing pages (home, pricing, about)",
      "├── (app)/                # Auth-required pages — guard in +layout.svelte",
      "├── (auth)/               # Login / register",
      "└── api/                  # API endpoints (+server.ts)",
      "```",
      "",
      "## File & Naming Conventions",
      "",
      "| Thing          | Rule                | Example           |",
      "| -------------- | ------------------- | ----------------- |",
      "| Component      | PascalCase          | `UserCard.svelte` |",
      "| Utility        | camelCase           | `formatDate.ts`   |",
      "| Route          | kebab-case          | `user-settings/`  |",
      "| Constant       | UPPER_SNAKE         | `MAX_RETRY = 3`   |",
      "| Type/Interface | PascalCase          | `UserProfile`     |",
      "| Server util    | `.server.ts` suffix | `auth.server.ts`  |",
      "",
      "## References",
      "",
      "- @DESIGN.md — UI / styling / visual. MUST follow, single source for design rules.",
      "",
    ],
  },
